    "uncertain: expected confirmed or retained-draft boundary visible",
    "offline: expected confirmed or retained-draft boundary visible",
    "refresh-failure: expected confirmed or retained-draft boundary visible",
    "Denied canonical read hides retained content and preserves a safe Back action",
    "Nested year-menu System Back closes the menu before the filter sheet",
    "Applied year/type and loaded older-page position survive canonical detail and System Back",
    "Direct composer without an origin falls back to canonical Moments",
    "Direct detail without an origin falls back to canonical Moments",
    "200% text and reduced system animation retain short-sheet and task actions"
